WHAT THIS REPO CONTAINS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

A reusable GitHub Actions workflow (`.github/workflows/eaa-audit.yml`) that
runs `@ariada-org/wcag-rules-extended` against one or more public URLs and emits
machine-readable EAA-compliance evidence (violations report, accessibility
statement, VPAT-JSON, `.well-known/accessibility.json`) as workflow artefacts.

No application code is shipped. No npm package is published. The artefact
consumers depend on is the workflow YAML — referenced via the standard
`uses: ariada-org/eaa-pipeline/.github/workflows/eaa-audit.yml@v1` syntax.

